<title>USA: Dell Computer Corp Q1 net rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Dell Computer Corp Q1 net rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>ROUND ROCK, Texas 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 FY'98	   Q1 FY'97</p>
<p> Net Sales			$2,588	     $1,638</p>
<p> Operating Income		  277		  112</p>
<p> Net Income			  198		   82</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share	     1.08		  .42</p>
<p> Weighted Avg. Shares O/S	184		  195</p>
<p>	 (in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest Q1 ended May 4. Year-ago quarter ended April 28.</p>
</text>
